 ('<h3 style="font-weight:500;font-size:1.1rem;margin:18px 0 6px;">Best time to visit</h3>', '<h3 style="font-weight:500;font-size:1.1rem;margin:18px 0 6px;">Meilleure p\u00e9riode</h3>'),
