 ("<span class=\"discover-src\">MEDINA</span><h4>Murals &amp; lanes</h4><p>Repainted festival artworks on whitewashed walls around every corner.</p>",
  "<span class=\"discover-src\">M\u00c9DINA</span><h4>Fresques et ruelles</h4><p>\u0152uvres du festival repeintes sur des murs blanchis \u00e0 chaque coin de rue.</p>"),
