 ('<span class="eyebrow">Abrid Morocco Destination</span>', '<span class="eyebrow">Destination Abrid Morocco</span>'),
 ('<p class="lead">The Red City &mdash; gateway to the Sahara, the Atlas and the coast. Where Morocco begins for most travellers, guided by people who call it home.</p>',
  '<p class="lead">La Ville Rouge — porte d\u2019entr\u00e9e vers le Sahara, l\u2019Atlas et la c\u00f4te. L\u00e0 o\u00f9 le Maroc commence pour la plupart des voyageurs, guid\u00e9s par des gens qui y vivent.</p>'),
